Machine Learning & Classification



&lt;span class="gallery-badge ml"&gt;Unsupervised ML&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="gallery-badge"&gt;Statcast&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;a href="analyses/pitch_clustering.html"&gt;Unsupervised Pitch Clustering&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;K-Means and Gaussian Mixture Models (GMM) applied to 3D trajectory and break vectors (&lt;code&gt;pfx_x&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;pfx_z&lt;/code&gt;, velocity, spin). Repertoire discovery without human pitch-tag bias.&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;hr style="margin: 0.75rem 0; border-color: #f1f5f9;"&gt;
&lt;small class="text-muted"&gt;Algorithm: K-Means / GMM | Dataset: Statcast Flight Dynamics&lt;/small&gt;




&lt;span class="gallery-badge ml"&gt;Supervised ML&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="gallery-badge"&gt;tidymodels&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;a href="analyses/pitch_classification.html"&gt;Pitch Type Classification with Random Forest&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Multi-class classification using &lt;code&gt;ranger&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;tidymodels&lt;/code&gt; to classify 6 distinct pitch types from raw flight physics. Out-of-fold ROC-AUC evaluation and confusion matrix diagnostics.&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;hr style="margin: 0.75rem 0; border-color: #f1f5f9;"&gt;
&lt;small class="text-muted"&gt;Algorithm: Random Forest (ranger) | Metrics: Accuracy & ROC-AUC&lt;/small&gt;

Empirical Sabermetrics & Non-Linear Surfaces



&lt;span class="gallery-badge sabermetrics"&gt;Q-CRISP Study 02&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="gallery-badge"&gt;Platoon Physics&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;a href="analyses/02_platoon_physics.html"&gt;4-Quadrant Platoon Physics &amp; PVI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Full-population RvR, RvL, LvL, and LvR analysis across 14.64M pitches: batter-perspective horizontal break (&lt;code&gt;hb_away_in&lt;/code&gt;), CSW%, xwOBA, TTO decay, and Pitcher Platoon Vulnerability Index.&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;hr style="margin: 0.75rem 0; border-color: #f1f5f9;"&gt;
&lt;small class="text-muted"&gt;Out-of-Time CSW% r = 0.886 | xwOBA r = 0.934 | Interactive Plotly&lt;/small&gt;




&lt;span class="gallery-badge sabermetrics"&gt;Sabermetrics&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="gallery-badge"&gt;GAM / LOESS&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;a href="analyses/xwoba_surface.html"&gt;Non-Linear xwOBA & Barrel Landscape&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fitting a 2D Generalized Additive Model (GAM) thin-plate spline over Exit Velocity and Launch Angle to map the continuous probability landscape of hits, extra bases, and Statcast "Barrels".&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;hr style="margin: 0.75rem 0; border-color: #f1f5f9;"&gt;
&lt;small class="text-muted"&gt;Model: 2D Thin-Plate Spline (mgcv) | Batted Balls: Statcast&lt;/small&gt;




&lt;span class="gallery-badge sabermetrics"&gt;Sabermetrics&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="gallery-badge"&gt;Retrosheet&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;a href="analyses/run_expectancy.html"&gt;Run Expectancy RE24 Matrix&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Empirical calculation of the 24 base-out run expectancy matrix directly from 23.8 million Retrosheet play events. Inning state transitions, run values per event, and game leverage indexing.&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;hr style="margin: 0.75rem 0; border-color: #f1f5f9;"&gt;
&lt;small class="text-muted"&gt;Dataset: 23.8M Retrosheet Plays | Coverage: 1871–2025&lt;/small&gt;
